WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.940
You're awake?

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.120
I was eaten by that Cerulean...

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.110
But I'm okay! Did you save me, Brown Bear?

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:15.910
No.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.730
Huh? Where's Kaban-chan?

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.120
On the boat?

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.480
Brown Bear? Where's Kaban-chan?

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.950
She was eaten by the Cerulean
when she saved you.

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.840
What? We have to save her, quick!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.140
When I went back, I found you collapsed, 
and Kaban was inside the Cerulean.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.530
There was nothing I could do.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.520
A lot of time has passed. 
It'll be morning soon.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.560
By now, she'll already be...

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.170
That can't be true! Let's go back again!

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:51.150
Kaban-chan's amazing. 
I'm sure she'll be fine!

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.910
It turned on. The Cerulean's coming!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.430
We have to finish this before sunrise.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.000
I'm going, even if I have 
to go alone! Wait here!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.700
I've seen what happens to Friends eaten 
by Ceruleans too many times to count.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.380
I'm sorry, but you have to give up.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.600
Boss, say something!

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:19.800
Oh, yeah. He only talks 
when Kaban-chan's around.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:24.810
Serval, leave this to me. 
You and Brown Bear go to Kaban.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.420
See? Boss agrees with me—

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.060
Boss?

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.360
Once Kaban is safe, lure the Cerulean here.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.320
As planned, when it steps onto 
the boat, I will make it fall.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.220
Okay! Come on, Brown Bear, let's go!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:44.910
Got it. We'll do what you think is best.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.960
But why did you talk to me?

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:53.490
Communication with Friends is only 
permitted when a human is in danger.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.320
As a rule, we are not to interfere 
with the natural ecosystem.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.480
I don't really get it, but it sounds like 
things are tough for you, too, Boss.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.860
In any case, I leave Kaban to you.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:05.570
The sun will rise soon. 
Leave this area to me.

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:08.770
Got it! All right, let's do this!

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:10.130
You two stay with the boat.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.380
Got your orders.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:12.270
Be careful.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.190
If things go wrong, run away.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:19.410
Serval. I had fun traveling with you both.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:25.090
Of course it was fun! And after we save 
Kaban-chan, we'll go to lots more places!

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:30.580
There it is!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:31.630
Yeah!

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.970
It's too overpowered...

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.440
Kaban-chan!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.240
That's Kaban-chan, right?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.390
It really is too late...

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.760
I have to go to her!

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:50.950
She's in almost the same place as the stone.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.370
We can't get her out in one hit.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.910
First, we have to make its legs collapse.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.730
Okay, we'll move behind it!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.910
We're not done yet!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.020
It's no use. It's too big.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.590
We can't even bring it to its knees...

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.810
We're not done yet!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.400
Meow, meow! Meow, meow!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.900
Meow, meow, meow! Meow, meow, meow!

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.900
Darn it!

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.020
Meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.330
Meow, meow, meow!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.220
Serval! Once we're past the trees and 
it sees the boat, it'll take off running!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.240
Move away from it!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.640
No! Kaban-chan's still...

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.240
She's still in there!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.230
Hey! Give back Kaban-chan!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.700
You give her back!

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.890
She's a scaredy-cat, but she's a sweetheart!

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.880
She thinks of all sorts of things 
to help those in need!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.350
She's a fighter!

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:02.140
There's so much we still 
have to talk about...

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.320
So many places I want to go with her...

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.010
Give her back!

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.540
Our strikes were shallow?

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.770
Not only is it huge, but it's hard, too. 
This will be difficult indeed.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:19.870
Professor!

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:21.760
Why?

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.070
We heard from Lucky Beast.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.870
A transmission came through 
a Lucky Beast near us.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.540
It is allowed if there is a 
human in the park, it said.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:36.080
We will do what we can, 
for we are the chiefs of this village.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:39.710
We will release our wild sides, 
for we are the chiefs of this village.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:54.050
I'm glad for the backup, but frankly, 
against an enemy this big...

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:56.700
Yes, this is the most we can do.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.520
Indeed. We alone are not enough.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.280
It's attacking!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.880
Good grief. Can't see in the dark, 
can't read maps...

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:07.970
She is all awkward. Good grief.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.140
Now... You will release your wild sides.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:14.110
We will show you the strength of our flock.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:33.140
You're a suspect!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.170
I caught you!

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.270
Woo-hoo! It's huge!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.620
Oh, Serval, your ears need work.

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:41.140
Protecting your friends...

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.780
...is an idol's job, too!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.840
Kaban! You alive in there?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:48.140
Even if the real world is looking 
more like a horror story...

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:02.420
Nice.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.450
I'm satisfied.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.520
How was that?

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:06.350
Perfect.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.420
Sorry you've gotta fly us back and forth.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.490
Take care of my fan.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:14.310
She's my guest, too.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:17.350
Help is here, Kaban!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.870
Don't you dare...

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.190
lay a paw on one of my girls!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.220
Now!

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:25.350
Comin' right up.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:26.360
Understood.

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:28.180
There we go.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.670
It really turned to rock?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.510
Wow!

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:34.080
Wow...

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.750
That's called volcanic rock, and— 
Wait, this isn't the time!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.930
Hurry, let's go fill it up again!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.270
We did it!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.310
How is she?!

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.230
She's...

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:04.740
Not good!

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:05.820
Don't let it attack!

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:19.490
Now!

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:21.950
Run away!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:40.650
It's going for the boat!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.600
Kaban-chan! Kaban-chan!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.310
No good?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.610
She's started to return to nature.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.320
Kaban-chan! No, Kaban-chan!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.240
We... We still have so much to...

00:07:56.670 --> 00:08:01.050
Serval, you must let go. 
She will return to her original form.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.420
Huh? Serval-chan?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:23.920
I-Is it really you, Kaban-chan? 
Do you recognize me?

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.480
Do you remember what we 
said when we first met?

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:32.190
Oh, yeah. "Please don't eat me."

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.280
I won't eat you!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:41.480
How? When a Cerulean eats you, 
don't you return to your animal form?

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:46.540
But she did. This is the form of a human.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.600
We Friends are animals who've
gained human characteristics.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.540
So even if a human Friend 
returned to their animal form,

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:53.770
they'd remain the same?

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:56.430
They truly are a mysterious species.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.010
More importantly, where's the Cerulean?

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.500
Boss!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.760
Lucky-san!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.760
Ka...

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:14.990
Ser...

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:42.650
When its stone sinks underwater, 
the entire Cerulean hardens?

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:46.070
The volcanic rock in other areas 
must be remnants from last time.

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:47.640
But...

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:50.070
Boss! Boss!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.320
Hello!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.210
Boss must be lost in the ocean, too...

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:59.320
No, he can't be! Just when 
he finally talked to me!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:03.500
Lucky-san! Please say something!

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.210
Boss?

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:12.040
Serval, Kaban, it's Boss!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:20.320
Hello. I am Lucky Beast.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.590
It is nice to meet you.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.470
What is your name?

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.840
This isn't our Boss, either...

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:27.080
Lucky-san...

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.270
Boss... You sacrificed yourself for us.

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.450
Lucky-san... Lucky-san...

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.750
Good morning, Kaban.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.710
Whoa! It talked!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.150
That was Lucky-san! We have to fish him out!

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:01.970
Huh?!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.570
Now you strengthen the fire.
"Cooking" requires the power of heat.

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:15.940
What? How do you make a fire stronger?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.880
You blow on it.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.700
H-Hey, hold on, now!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.220
We have tea, too. Here, for you.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.410
And for you.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:28.980
Singing with my friends...

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:32.950
Dancing with my friends...

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.420
Dancing!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:39.090
An inland collaboration... 
It would be a dream come true!

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:42.640
I must climb up to that hole!

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.930
Woo-hoo! Woo-hoo!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.290
Skip, skip!

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:51.060
I like this bed. So lazy...

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:54.670
Looks like they've already started.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:57.610
Incredible. There are so many Friends here.

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:01.900
This is the amusement park. 
It has many rides.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.760
The guest of honor is here.

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:05.490
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.650
It's been a month since the 
battle, so it's a bit late,

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:12.470
but welcome to the 
"Cerulean Safely Defeated"

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:15.960
slash "Kaban's Species Discovered" Party!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.130
Before we eat, let's start with some remarks.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.450
Congrats on everything. 
You rocked it out there!

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.990
Er... No, it was thanks to all of you.

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:27.800
Thank you.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:30.130
So the Cerulean actually ate you at one point.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:33.740
Yeah... Though I hardly remember it.

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:36.270
Thanks to everyone's help, I made it out.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:39.820
And you found out what kind of 
animal you are along the way?

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:43.150
Yes! I'm a human.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.690
So she found out. That's great.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:49.580
Thank goodness. I'm so relieved.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:54.010
I still don't know where my territory is, 
but I want to go search for it.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.870
I couldn't have done it without all of you.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:12:59.790
You're...

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.090
It seems that humans are long-winded.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.560
Just let us eat.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.260
You already are!

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.830
Okay, let's eat!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.320
Let's eat!

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.890
So fun!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.730
Wait for me!

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:23.770
Those are some strong-looking arms. 
Want to compete with me?

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:25.900
H-Huh?!

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:31.200
Just when they thought the case 
would go unsolved, her eyes glared!

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.350
The glaring...

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:37.500
Wh-What happens next? What'll happen next?!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.180
Why don't you try that 
"cooking" on a Japari bun?

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:45.040
Oh, my! This is even more delicious.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:48.180
I'd like to add it to the lodge's breakfast.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:53.850
So I was chasing the hat on the day 
of the eruption, and that's when...

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.470
Sounds like the pattern of 
a hair turning into a Friend.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:10.510
Huh? Huh?

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.890
What does that mean?

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:15.880
Why are you hiding? How suspicious...

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.370
It calms me!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.440
From what Kaban says,

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:24.050
it sounds like the humans aggressively 
worked to counter the Ceruleans.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.060
I see. So that is why the Ceruleans 
were found near humans.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:30.600
Rather, it is the humans 
who were near Ceruleans.

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:34.720
I think I understand the feelings that 
drove them to try and protect the park.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.310
Was Boss okay?

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:41.130
Uh-huh! He's really tiny now, 
but he's just fine.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:44.420
He still won't talk to me, though.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.630
Did he <i>really</i> talk to you?

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:52.950
It's true! He said it was okay to talk to us 
if there was, um, a threat to a human?

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:58.610
Serval-chan, say you're going to eat me.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.200
Huh? Why?

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.270
I won't eat you.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:02.780
It's an idea I just had.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:04.210
Well, okay...

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.020
Rawr! I'll eat you!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.010
Please don't eat me!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.050
Serval. Do not eat her.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.040
He spoke to Serval!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:15.930
You can talk to him like this.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.390
Awesome!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:23.830
It hasn't always been easy, but you've 
really adapted to living in the park now.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:26.020
Thanks to you and the others.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:29.030
I'm sorry that you never went 
back to the Savanna Area,

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.150
since you've stayed at the harbor with me.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:34.750
It's okay! I had fun tying up the loose ends.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.660
Volcanic rock is amazing, though.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.830
I had no idea what might 
happen when it moved.

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:44.500
We're lucky we had a boat. Who knows 
how it might have turned out without it?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:45.810
The boat...

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:51.300
You wanted to meet humans in 
the outside world, didn't you?

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.920
I do want to know more about my species.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:59.360
But I've made lots of friends here, 
so the outside world...

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.110
It can wait until later.

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.890
Let's ride that!

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:12.780
What brought this on, Serval-chan?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.930
Come on, come on!

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:17.530
You're acting strange. Are you okay?

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:21.580
S-S-Serval-chan, are you sure this is safe?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.900
It's fine! They said the 
professor adjusted it earlier.

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.380
This is another "attraction" thingy.

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.260
Something fell from the sky!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.040
Wow, you can see so far across the park.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:45.100
Y-Yeah. It's scary, but pretty.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:50.400
Mirai-san?

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:54.470
I had to ride this one last time.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:59.720
In the end, those of us on the park 
staff have to evacuate the island...

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.730
I'm sad that it's already over,

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:06.100
but grateful for all the many 
miracles I got to see here.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:10.740
I'm sure I'll be back again. 
Lucky, watch the park for me, okay?

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:12.020
Leave it to me.

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:14.940
Sorry. I promise I'll be back soon.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.530
Mirai-san!

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:20.420
The outside world...

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.670
Kaban-san.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:30.820
We have something for you.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.860
You do?

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.550
What is it?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.110
A present.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:42.760
Yup.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.000
It is!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:47.380
The bus! You fixed it?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.710
Serval-chan, did you know about this?

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.270
We all fixed it together.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.220
The professor and assistant helped,

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:58.460
and Beaver and Prairie Dog did this part, 
and Silver Fox did that part, and...

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:02.580
Is this why you kept disappearing?

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.410
Huh?

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.150
Huh? Why are you...

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.390
Be careful, okay?

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.380
If you get hungry, eat lots of Japari buns.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.220
Thank you so much.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.950
If not for all of you, I...

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:40.510
Hey, we'd have been lost without 
you, too. You saved the park!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:45.970
Thanks to you, we can sleep soundly. 
Make sure you get enough sleep too, okay?

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.300
We discovered lots of new things with you.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:56.050
Thanks to you, I have my dream job.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:02.930
We know you'll be fine.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:03.990
We do.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.530
Take it easy out there.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.000
Keep charging straight ahead!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.250
You'll really be okay alone?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:17.910
Yeah. I don't know what kind of island 
I'm going to, or even if it really exists.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:20.560
So I couldn't ask you to come along.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:25.600
But I promise to bring back 
anything delicious or fun.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.730
I'm worried...

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:32.600
When things get too hard, 
it's okay to ask for help.

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:37.480
Huh?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:42.070
Meow... Meow, meow...

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:45.870
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow, meow!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.980
Look, everyone!

00:19:56.330 --> 00:20:01.690
You taught me how to search for food, 
and how to sleep safely.

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.180
I can even climb trees now.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.720
So don't worry about me!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:13.600
Well, I'm leaving now.

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.910
Um...

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:34.790
It operates in basically 
the same way as the bus.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:35.650
Now...

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.210
Shall we?

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:39.690
Yeah.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.540
Hey! Everything shipshape?

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.420
Is it working?

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:41.230
Lucky-san, I see the island!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.530
Does that island have a name, too?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.320
That would be the Gokoku Region.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:50.690
As it is a different jurisdiction, 
I do not know much about it myself.

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:55.010
Like the Kyoshu Region, 
it consists of several Areas.

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:58.330
It is possible that there are Friends there.

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:10.930
<b>The End</b>

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:10.030
<b>The End</b>

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:08.680
B-B-Battery... The bus's battery is dead...

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:09.680
Here?!

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:12.650
Uh-oh! We have to stop, too!

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.210
Stop. Stop!

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:23.010
Serval-chan! Everyone!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:26.690
We wanted to come with you 
just a little longer, after all!

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:28.320
You guys...

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:31.040
What's this now? Where are you all heading?

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:34.680
What kind of Friend are you?

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.730
Let's be friends!
